                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Steam cannot even begin to number the true number of hours that I have been playing this game. When I first played Bejeweled 2, I was 3 years old. Before then, I had only ever read kids books and watched TV. I was kept under strict supervision and forbidden from touching a computer. Then, when my mom was at work, my dad showed me this game on my grandpa's Compaq Presario, and I was utterly blown away. The music (I only was allowed to listen to classical back then), bright at the time colors, and the mechanical puzzle aspect were just a wonderful soup of addiction for my 3 year old brain that led to my dad further introducing me to Peggle, Dragon Quest and Dance Dance Revolution. All of those games had a hand in shaping my personality today. But this one was the beginning of the chain reaction.\r\n\r\nTL;DR, if you have or know a 3 year old show them this game, they will never be the same person I promise you",
